{
  "name": "TestRetryFirstReturnsRecoveryValueAfterRetryExhausts",
  "comment": "Order=RetryFirst with retry=1: retry runs once (re-throws), then recovery's chain runs and its value propagates (handle.cs:120-131). This is the symmetry the 2026-04-27 fix unblocked — before that, this branch returned Ok() instead of recoveryResult, Handled was not set, and the value was lost. Asserting %!error% null after the scope is the symmetry pin.",
  "step": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "text": "throw error \"boom\", on error set %content% = \"from-recovery\", order RetryFirst, retry 1",
